or up at all times... <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4011-weaverchilde","name":"Weaverchilde","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T10:18:32-08:00","id":1003465,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4011-weaverchilde\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4011\" data-vbnamecard=\"4011\">Weaverchilde</a> They can but remember that it takes one mana for every scene of having armor up. It' usually 3-5 per session. Make sure that they use it for other purposes e.g. remote casting, paradox mitigation, focused mage sight and they'll need to choose. Also remember to put some minor inconveniences like beeing less likable when when having mind armor - people around start to stutter. Life - your skin looks weird. Space, Time - looking at the character hurts the eyes. Etc","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T11:38:15-08:00","id":1003507,"title":"","content":"I was not really thinking of their armors being visible / side effect during non-combat situations since the attainments do not mention such possible drawbacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4011-weaverchilde","name":"Weaverchilde","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T12:59:58-08:00","id":1003552,"title":"","content":"Little details are up to ST and you can run in by RAW but you can't lose anything by making magic more real and alive. Attainment are not omniscient so when you jumpscare a time mage he will jump away unnaturally fast and anyone who looks in his way will notice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T03:28:29-08:00","id":1003843,"title":"","content":"Or you could just wait til they run out if mana wasting it on armor in scenes with no combat and <i>then</i> start a fight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}